{"seq":3,"slug":"guarantee-risk-monitor","title":"担保风险与额度预警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-tax-guarantee-bond-insurance/guarantee-ops-optimize/guarantee-risk-monitor","wordCount":2755,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"担保风险与额度预警\">担保风险与额度预警</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>担保运营需要一个早期报警系统。要报警的对象有四类：额度快不够了、放行开始失败了、担保过度集中在少数机构、以及逾期风险在累积。四类的共同特征是——它们在爆发前都有可观测的前兆，而让它们爆发的代价都远高于提前处置的成本。逾期之所以是整个体系的最高优先级风险，是因为它有明确的、制度化的连锁后果：企业逾期未缴纳税款的，海关可以停止其办理关税保证保险通关业务（<a href=\"https://jrj.wuhan.gov.cn/ztzl_57/xyrd/bxy/201912/t20191217_169735.shtml\">金融时报报道</a>），而条例将&quot;没有拖欠应纳税款&quot;列为免除担保的法定条件之一（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/flfg/2010-09/19/content_1709252.htm\">国务院令第581号</a>）。本篇为每一类定义指标、阈值与处置动作，并给出指标之间的耦合关系，因为单独看任何一项都会误判。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四类风险的指标定义\">四类风险的指标定义</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[担保风险预警体系] --&gt; B[额度类]&#10;  A --&gt; C[放行类]&#10;  A --&gt; D[集中度类]&#10;  A --&gt; E[信用类]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[额度使用率]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[额度耗尽预测天数]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[担保品到期窗口]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[放行失败率]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[额度扣减失败率]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[降级路径触发频次]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[单一机构担保占比]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[单一工具占比]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[押品型工具占比]&#10;  E --&gt; E1[缴税及时率]&#10;  E --&gt; E2[报关差错率]&#10;  E --&gt; E3[额度泄漏量]\">graph TD\n  A[担保风险预警体系] --&gt; B[额度类]\n  A --&gt; C[放行类]\n  A --&gt; D[集中度类]\n  A --&gt; E[信用类]\n  B --&gt; B1[额度使用率]\n  B --&gt; B2[额度耗尽预测天数]\n  B --&gt; B3[担保品到期窗口]\n  C --&gt; C1[放行失败率]\n  C --&gt; C2[额度扣减失败率]\n  C --&gt; C3[降级路径触发频次]\n  D --&gt; D1[单一机构担保占比]\n  D --&gt; D2[单一工具占比]\n  D --&gt; D3[押品型工具占比]\n  E --&gt; E1[缴税及时率]\n  E --&gt; E2[报关差错率]\n  E --&gt; E3[额度泄漏量]</pre><h3 id=\"额度使用率与耗尽预测\">额度使用率与耗尽预测</h3><p>额度使用率的定义必须明确分母。用&quot;占用/总额度&quot;会低估风险，因为可用额度还受冻结影响。正确的口径是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>used_amount</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>frozen_amount</mtext></mrow><mtext>total_amount</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = \\frac{\\text{used\\_amount} + \\text{frozen\\_amount}}{\\text{total\\_amount}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3904em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total_amount</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">used_amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">frozen_amount</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>比瞬时使用率更有用的是<strong>耗尽预测天数</strong>：按最近 N 天的日均占用增量外推，还有多少天额度会用尽。它把静态比率变成时间维度，让预警可以直接驱动动作——&quot;7 天后额度将耗尽&quot;比&quot;使用率 85%&quot;更可操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 额度耗尽预测: 近30日日均增量外推&#10;WITH daily_consumption AS (&#10;  SELECT filing_no,&#10;         date_trunc(&#39;day&#39;, occurred_at) AS d,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN event_type = &#39;CONFIRM&#39; THEN amount&#10;                  WHEN event_type = &#39;RELEASE&#39; THEN -amount&#10;                  ELSE 0 END) AS net_change&#10;    FROM quota_event&#10;   WHERE occurred_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;   GROUP BY filing_no, date_trunc(&#39;day&#39;, occurred_at)&#10;),&#10;rate AS (&#10;  SELECT filing_no,&#10;         AVG(net_change) AS avg_daily_net,&#10;         STDDEV_POP(net_change) AS sd_daily_net&#10;    FROM daily_consumption GROUP BY filing_no&#10;)&#10;SELECT p.filing_no,&#10;       p.total_amount,&#10;       p.used_amount + p.frozen_amount AS committed,&#10;       p.total_amount - p.used_amount - p.frozen_amount AS available,&#10;       ROUND(r.avg_daily_net, 2) AS avg_daily_net,&#10;       CASE WHEN r.avg_daily_net &lt;= 0 THEN NULL&#10;            ELSE ROUND((p.total_amount - p.used_amount - p.frozen_amount)&#10;                       / r.avg_daily_net, 1)&#10;       END AS days_to_exhaustion,&#10;       r.sd_daily_net&#10;  FROM quota_pool p JOIN rate r USING (filing_no)&#10; WHERE p.total_amount - p.used_amount - p.frozen_amount &gt;= 0&#10; ORDER BY days_to_exhaustion NULLS LAST;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 额度耗尽预测: 近30日日均增量外推</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_consumption </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filing_no,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, occurred_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CONFIRM'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RELEASE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_change</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_event</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> occurred_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filing_no, date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, occurred_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filing_no,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_change) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_daily_net,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         STDDEV_POP(net_change) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sd_daily_net</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_consumption </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filing_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filing_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">used_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> committed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">used_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg_daily_net</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_daily_net,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg_daily_net</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">used_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                       /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg_daily_net</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> days_to_exhaustion,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sd_daily_net</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_pool p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rate r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (filing_no)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">used_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> days_to_exhaustion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULLS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>阈值设定应当结合企业的<strong>补充额度所需时间</strong>：若启动加保到海关备案完成需要 20 天，那么 <code>days_to_exhaustion &lt; 25</code> 就应当触发红色预警，而不是等到小于 7 天。这与 <a href=\"../bond-lifecycle-claim/bond-issue-amend-cancel\">保函的开立、变更与注销</a> 中&quot;重叠期下限按备案实际耗时校准&quot;是同一条原则。</p>\n<h3 id=\"标准差是预警的必要输入\">标准差是预警的必要输入</h3><p>上面的查询同时输出 <code>sd_daily_net</code>，因为只按均值外推会低估风险。占用波动大的关区（均值低但方差高）在均值口径下看起来很安全，实际却可能因某个单日高峰直接耗尽额度。可用的判据是取悲观情形：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>days_pessimistic</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>available</mtext><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{days\\_pessimistic} = \\frac{\\text{available}}{\\mu + 2\\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">days_pessimistic</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">available</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用这个口径排序，波动大的额度池会被正确地排到前面。这与 <a href=\"../tax-guarantee-instrument/guarantee-instrument-choice\">担保工具的选择与成本比较</a> 中&quot;按高分位数设额度&quot;是同一个统计思想的两种应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"放行类指标\">放行类指标</h2><p>放行失败率是结果指标，它一旦上升说明问题已经发生。真正有价值的是它的<strong>分解指标</strong>：额度扣减失败率与降级路径触发频次。</p>\n<h3 id=\"额度扣减失败率\">额度扣减失败率</h3><p>定义是&quot;海关回执确认扣减失败的票数 / 总申报票数&quot;。它按失败原因分桶后极具诊断价值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败原因</th>\n<th>指向的系统问题</th>\n<th>处置方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>额度不足</td>\n<td>额度核定偏低或泄漏</td>\n<td>检查泄漏，调整核定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发冲突</td>\n<td>额度服务竞争激烈</td>\n<td>扩容或分片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回执超时</td>\n<td>对接链路不稳定</td>\n<td>检查接口可用性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>备案编号无效</td>\n<td>备案状态与申报不一致</td>\n<td>校验备案状态同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>担保品被暂停</td>\n<td>外部状态变化未及时同步</td>\n<td>提高状态同步频率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这份分桶表的用法是看<strong>趋势而非绝对值</strong>：某类原因连续两周上升，就该在该类上投入排查。绝对值本身受业务量影响，不具可比性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"降级路径触发频次\">降级路径触发频次</h3><p>降级路径（拆票、改担保方式、临时追加担保）的触发频次是额度健康度的间接指标。它上升的典型含义是额度跟不上业务增长。这里需要警惕一种误判：企业主动选择拆票（例如为分散风险）与被迫拆票在指标上无法区分。因此系统应当在触发时记录<strong>触发理由码</strong>，人为选择与额度不足的拆票必须分开统计。这与 <a href=\"guarantee-reconcile-audit\">担保台账对账与审计</a> 中&quot;人工操作强制理由码&quot;是同一套设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集中度风险\">集中度风险</h2><p>集中度风险指的是担保过度依赖单一机构、单一工具或单一押品类型。它的危害是相关性风险——当那一个依赖失效时，企业没有替代方案。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三个集中度指标\">三个集中度指标</h3><p>第一个是<strong>单一机构担保占比</strong>：最大机构的担保金额除以总担保金额。它偏高的后果是，一旦该机构因自身原因（收紧授信政策、内部调整）无法续做，企业短期内找不到替代。可接受的阈值通常取决于企业规模——大型企业可以承受较高集中度（谈判力强、替代渠道多），中小企业应当更分散。</p>\n<p>第二个是<strong>单一工具占比</strong>。过度依赖保证金意味着现金被大量占压，且失去了工具间的替代弹性。</p>\n<p>第三个是<strong>押品型工具占比</strong>，即&quot;保证金加有押品反担保的保函&quot;在总担保中的比例。它直接对应 <a href=\"guarantee-cost-cash-optimize\">担保成本与现金占用优化</a> 里的 <code>lock_to_tax_ratio</code>，比例偏高说明担保结构对现金占用过重。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算</th>\n<th>高值的风险</th>\n<th>处置方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一机构占比</td>\n<td>最大机构担保金额 / 总担保金额</td>\n<td>机构退出即无替代</td>\n<td>培育第二家担保机构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单一工具占比</td>\n<td>最大工具担保金额 / 总担保金额</td>\n<td>失去工具弹性</td>\n<td>逐步引入互补工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>押品型工具占比</td>\n<td>(保证金+有押品保函) / 总担保</td>\n<td>现金占压过重</td>\n<td>转向信用型工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"集中度与费率的权衡\">集中度与费率的权衡</h3><p>分散集中度是有代价的：每一家新增机构都有开户、审批、系统对接的固定成本，且分散会削弱单家机构的议价能力，可能推高费率。因此集中度目标不是&quot;越低越好&quot;，而是一个双边约束——既要保留替代方案，又不显著抬高费率。可操作的规则是给每家关键机构设定一个<strong>最低保留份额</strong>（例如不低于 15%），确保它在被需要时仍愿意服务，同时不追求完全均衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信用类指标与逾期前置预警\">信用类指标与逾期前置预警</h2><p>逾期是最严重的风险事件，因为它会触发 <a href=\"../bond-lifecycle-claim/customs-claim-payout\">海关索赔与垫付处置</a> 描述的全链条后果。逾期很难事后补救，因此必须在事前预警。</p>\n<h3 id=\"缴税及时率的滚动窗口\">缴税及时率的滚动窗口</h3><p>单次逾期是结果，及时率是过程。可用的口径是滚动 12 个月的&quot;在期限内缴清月数/总月数&quot;。它比单次是否逾期更能预测趋势，也更符合制度对企业的考察方式——免除担保的条件是&quot;连续两年&quot;满足各项要求，看的是持续性而非单点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;credit_risk_monitor&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;enterprise_id&quot;: &quot;91310000XXXXXXXXXX&quot;,&#10;    &quot;as_of&quot;: &quot;2026-09-30&quot;,&#10;    &quot;metrics&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;payment_timeliness_12m&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: 0.958, &quot;months_on_time&quot;: 23, &quot;months_total&quot;: 24 },&#10;      &quot;declaration_error_rate_12m&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: 0.021, &quot;threshold&quot;: 0.03 },&#10;      &quot;administrative_penalties_24m&quot;: 0,&#10;      &quot;criminal_investigations&quot;: 0,&#10;      &quot;quota_leak_amount&quot;: 0,&#10;      &quot;unreleased_over_threshold_items&quot;: 2&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;qualification_impact&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;exemption_eligible&quot;: false,&#10;      &quot;blocking_reasons&quot;: [&quot;consecutive_2_years_not_met&quot;],&#10;      &quot;aeo_pilot_eligible&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;alerts&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;code&quot;: &quot;PAYMENT_NEAR_DUE&quot;,&#10;        &quot;level&quot;: &quot;AMBER&quot;,&#10;        &quot;detail&quot;: &quot;本期汇总税额 312.48 万, 缴款期限 T-3 天, 额度可用 121.4 万&quot;,&#10;        &quot;action&quot;: &quot;确认资金到位; 额度不足时提前申请加保&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"credit_risk_monitor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"enterprise_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"91310000XXXXXXXXXX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"as_of\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-30\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"metrics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"payment_timeliness_12m\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.958</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"months_on_time\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">23</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"